  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n -\n +\n ÷\n ×\n \n \n\n Stands for\n ÷\n ×\n -\n +\n \n \n\nSo checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) 20 ÷ 3 × 9 + 5 - 2 = 50 ⇒ 20 - 3 + 9 × 5 ÷ 2 = 50\n\n⇒ 20 - 3 + 9 × __**5 ÷ 2**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 20 - 3 + __**9 × 2.5**__ = 50\n\n⇒ __**20 + 22.5**__ - 3 = 50\n\n⇒ __**42.5 - 3**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 39.5 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 20 + 3 - 9 ÷ 5 × 2 = 20 ⇒ 20 × 3 ÷ 9 - 5 + 2 = 20\n\n⇒ 20 × __**3 ÷ 9**__ - 5 + 2 = 20\n\n⇒ __**20 × 0.33**__ - 5 + 2 = 20\n\n⇒ __**6.6 + 2**__ - 5 = 20\n\n⇒ __8.6 - 5__ = 20\n\n⇒ 3.6 ≠ 20 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 20 - 3 + 9 × 5 ÷ 2 = 63 ⇒ 20 ÷ 3 × 9 + 5 - 2 = 63\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 3**__ × 9 + 5 - 2 = 63\n\n⇒ __**6.67 × 9**__ + 5 - 2 = 63\n\n⇒ __**60 + 5**__ - 2 = 63\n\n⇒ __**65 - 2**__ = 63\n\n**⇒ 63 = 63 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 20 × 3 ÷ 9 - 5 + 2 = 63 ⇒ 20 + 3 - 9 ÷ 5 × 2 = 63\n\n⇒ 20 + 3 - __**9 ÷ 5**__ × 2 = 63\n\n⇒ 20 + 3 - __**1.8 × 2**__ = 63\n\n⇒ __**20 + 3**__ - 3.6 = 63\n\n⇒ __**23 - 3.6**__ = 63\n\n⇒ 19.4 ≠ 63 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
